<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia's SFE wheat futures quiet.</title>
<headline>Australia's SFE wheat futures quiet.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sydney Futures Exchange (SFE) wheat futures trading was quiet on Wednesday with the January 1998 contract trading three 50-tonne lots.</p>
<p>The traded price of A$169 a tonne was steady on Tuesday's settlement but up A$3 on Tuesday's traded price.</p>
<p>Settlement prices for the untraded contracts were mostly higher.</p>
